# Environment Variables
# ---------------------
# This starter requires NO environment variables.
# It is a fully static site with zero external service dependencies.
#
# If you later add features that need configuration (e.g., a contact form
# backend or analytics), you can add variables here and reference them
# in your code via import.meta.env.PUBLIC_* (client) or import.meta.env.*
# (server/build-time only).
